{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7BlinkID21BarcodeModuleSettingsV21pdf417ScanningEnabledSbvp","symbolKind":"property","title":"pdf417ScanningEnabled","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"BlinkID"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"pdf417ScanningEnabled"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Enables the scanning and processing of Pdf417 barcodes."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkID\/documentation\/BlinkID\/BarcodeModuleSettings\/pdf417ScanningEnabled","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pdf417ScanningEnabled","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current analyzer model flags a barcode as “present” if either a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PDF417"},{"type":"text","text":" or a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"QR"},{"type":"text","text":" code is detected."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because the model does not distinguish between the two types at this stage, a conflict can occur:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PDF417"},{"type":"text","text":" is enabled but "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"QR"},{"type":"text","text":" is disabled, the analyzer may trigger for a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"QR"},{"type":"text","text":" code, causing the process to hang."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlin